# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Poin-poin utama {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can keep these key takeaways in mind:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mengingat poin-poin utama ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are still intractable computational problems that classical computers cannot solve.\n"
msgstr "Masih ada masalah komputasi yang tidak dapat diselesaikan oleh komputer klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computers expand what is possible to design into algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Komputer kuantum memperluas apa yang mungkin dirancang ke dalam algoritma.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The qubit is the basic quantum unit of information.\n"
msgstr "qubit adalah unit kuantum dasar informasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A quantum superposition can have exponentially more states than a classical superposition.\n"
msgstr "Superposisi kuantum dapat memiliki secara eksponensial lebih banyak keadaan dari superposisi klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum superposition is more powerful than classical probabilism but weaker than exponential parallelism.\n"
msgstr "Superposisi kuantum lebih kuat dari probabilisme klasik tetapi lebih lemah dari paralelisme eksponensial.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In an entangled state, the whole system is in a definite state even though the parts are not.\n"
msgstr "Dalam keadaan terikat, seluruh sistem berada dalam keadaan yang pasti meskipun bagian-bagiannya tidak.\n"
